{
  "$comment": "Blender-built garden things and lights (tools/art/blender/families/garden_things.py): the garden pond, the planter box, the birdhouse, the bird feeders, the dog house, the sundial, the stepping stones, the garden lamp post and the string lights. Listed in the base manifest's packs. The materials map onto the game's finishes so a model costs one draw call per finish group. The pond's ripples spread near the camera (`ripple`, ambient) and a koi comes up for `feedFish` (`fish`) and now and then while watched (`surface`); a blue tit lands on the feeders for `birdwatch` (`bird`); the lamp's panes and the bulbs glow at night, and the string sways near the camera (`sway`, ambient). The planter box and the lamp post have far versions.",
